"Hollow Mountain's stelae record the curse the new gods laid on the old gods, naming them all."
"The stelae name the new gods as mortals: Emeric, Maranor, Maradoc, Neriad, Sardanal, Nous, Efestar."
"Emeric's band of mortals stormed Hollow Mountain when they overthrew the old gods."
"Neriad and Maradoc razed the Hollow Mountain temple long ago."
"The corrupted garden in Hollow Mountain was made by Gomogog and twisted when he fell."
